comment = "This palette was based on my first ever palette, where I just did whatever felt right and actually made a 24 color palette. This is a version that started out at 10, the reddish ramp, the orange yellow green, dark green, cyan but I added the other colors and got an even 16. All the colors can work with each other in many ways in different ramps."
